{
  "$schema": "../../schema/livery.schema.json",
  "id": "excellence-awards-2025",
  "airline": "ACA",
  "name": "Employee Excellence Awards 2025",
  "kind": "special",
  "from": "2025-04",
  "confidence": "high",
  "drawnOn": "B789",
  "description": "Air Canada's 2017 white and black (white fuselage over a black belly, black cockpit mask, black fin with the red roundel, black engines) on 787-9 C-FSBV (fin 852), with the 2025 Excellence Award recipients honoured on it. Over the windows behind the wing, from ahead of the third door to ahead of the fourth, 'EXCELLENCE | 2025' in thin, widely spaced black capitals with a thin upright bar between the word and the year (the same words and order on both sides, so on the right side the year is forward). Under it, in smaller black semibold upper- and lowercase ending at the same point: 'Congratulations to our award-winning employees' on the left, 'Félicitations à nos employés lauréats' on the right. On the black fin under the roundel, the 55 recipients' names in small white type, in alphabetical order, in rows that fill the fin from its leading edge to its trailing edge: 17 rows on the left side, 18 on the right (the rows break differently on each side). 'AIR CANADA', the small roundel and the Star Alliance star forward as in the standard scheme.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:C-FSBV@PEK_(20250602160725).jpg",
      "title": "C-FSBV@PEK (20250602160725).jpg (CC BY-SA 4.0, N509FZ)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-23",
      "note": "Left side on approach to Beijing, 2025-06-02, nearly side-on from a little below (fitted to the 787-9 shape, 7° below; doors within 6 px): every left-side position, the belly line and the fin's 17 rows of names (read off the 6898 px original). The wing hides 'EX' of the title."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:C-FSBV@PEK_(20250530154223).jpg",
      "title": "C-FSBV@PEK (20250530154223).jpg (CC BY-SA 4.0, N509FZ)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-23",
      "note": "Right side on approach to Beijing, 2025-05-30, nearly side-on (flipped and fitted, 5° below; doors within 15 px, so positions taken relative to the doors): the whole 'EXCELLENCE | 2025', the French line, the fin's 18 rows of names, the roundel."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:C-FSBV@PEK_(20250824153720).jpg",
      "title": "C-FSBV@PEK (20250824153720).jpg (CC BY-SA 4.0, N509FZ)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-23",
      "note": "Left side from ahead and below, 2025-08-24: checked only (too oblique to measure); shows the whole left title, 'EXCELLENCE' starting just ahead of the third door, as drawn."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Air_Canada_-_Boeing_787-9_Dreamliner_(Excellence_2025_Livery)_C-FSBV_(55156244385).jpg",
